Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 02:01:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3729/3799] soh: rename func_80B572F0 ->
 EnZl3_GetTextIdForScene

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: returns 0x71A8, 0x71A9 or 0x71AB according to which of the two collapse scenes is loaded
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c
index 383fc4808..a9cd89baf 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl3/z_en_zl3.c
@@ -1808,7 +1808,8 @@ void EnZl3_StepYawAlongPathSegment(EnZl3* this) {
     this->actor.shape.rot.y = *rotY;
 }
 
-u16 func_80B572F0(PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B572F0: returns 0x71A8, 0x71A9 or 0x71AB according to which of the two collapse scenes is loaded
+u16 EnZl3_GetTextIdForScene(PlayState* play) {
     s16 sceneNum = play->sceneNum;
     u16 ret;
 
@@ -1834,7 +1835,7 @@ void func_80B57350(EnZl3* this, PlayState* play) {
 
     if (ABS(temp_v0) <= 0x4300) {
         this->actor.flags |= ACTOR_FLAG_ATTENTION_ENABLED | ACTOR_FLAG_FRIENDLY;
-        this->actor.textId = func_80B572F0(play);
+        this->actor.textId = EnZl3_GetTextIdForScene(play);  // was func_80B572F0 [LLM:HIGH]
         Actor_OfferTalkNearColChkInfoCylinder(&this->actor, play);
     }
 }
